WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.303
THERE IS A DESPERATE
SEARCH AND RESCUE OPERATION

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:10.944
UNDER WAY ACROSS TURKEY AND
SYRIA AFTER A MASSIVE 7.8

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:13.113
MAGNITUDE EARTHQUAKE RIPPED
THROUGH THE TWO COUNTRIES BEFORE

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:16.049
DAWN.
THE DEATH TOLL NOW TOPS 2,700

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:20.419
AND WILL LIKE WILL KEEP RISING
AS CREWS DIG THROUGH THE RUBBLE.

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:24.357
MORE THAN 120 AFTERSHOCKS HIT
AFTER THE EARTHQUAKE, INCLUDING

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:27.794
ONE ALMOST AS POWERFUL AS THE
EARTHQUAKE ITSELF.

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:30.196
BUILDINGS CRUMBLED TO THE
GROUND.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.833
PEOPLE FEARED TRAPPED INSIDE.
OTHERS HAVING TO RUN FOR THEIR

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:37.270
LIVES.
RESCUERS HAVING TO REACH THOSE

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.040
WHO ARE STUCK UNDER PILES OF
CONCRETE AND DEBRIS, LIKE THIS

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.110
BOY IN NORTHERN SYRIA.
YOU CAN JUST MAKE HIM OUT BURIED

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.946
UNDER THE WRECKAGE.
THANKFULLY HE WAS PULLED THE

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.715
SAFETY.
RESCUERS ALSO PULLING THIS

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.950
LITTLE GIRL FROM THE DEBRIS IN
ANOTHER SYRIAN CITY.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:54.787
THE U.S. AND OTHER COUNTRIES ARE
OFFERING WHATEVER HELP THEY CAN.

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:58.158
AND PRESIDENT BIDEN SAID HE HAS
DIRECTED HIS TEAM TO PROVIDE ANY

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:07.100
AND ALL ASSISTANCE IMMEDIATELY.
CNN'S JUMANA IS IN TURTY.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.402
TEAMS DEPLOYED THROUGHOUT THAT
CITY.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:10.870
WHAT IS THE LATEST?
YOU HAVE BEEN REPORTING ALL DAY

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:17.243
FOR US.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: UTTER DEVASTATION

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:21.314
STRETCHING ACROSS TEN PROVINCES
IN SOUTHERN TURKEY AND ACROSS

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:30.590
THE BORDER.
IN SYRIA YOU'VE GOT IMPACTED

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:33.393
AREAS IN GOVERNMENT CONTROLLED
PARTS OF SYRIA AS WELL AS THE

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:36.863
VERY VULNERABLE PARTS OF SYRIA
THAT ARE UNDER OPPOSITION

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:39.599
CONTROL.
THESE ARE PARTS OF THE COUNTRY

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:42.936
WHERE YOU HAVE MORE THAN 4
MILLION PEOPLE WHO HAVE BEEN

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.738
DISPLACED BY WAR, PEOPLE WHO HAD
NOTHING.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:49.309
AND NOW THEY ARE FINDING
THEMSELVES IN THIS SITUATION,

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:53.613
AND THEY JUST DON'T HAVE THE
RESOURCES AND THE CAPABILITIES

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:58.851
TO DEAL WITH THIS DISASTER.
WE ARE GETTING INFORMATION EVERY

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:03.289
FEW MINUTES, THIS DEATH TOLL
THAT IS CONTINUING TO RISE,

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:08.895
ACCORDING TO TURKISH OFFICIALS,
MORE THAN 1,600 PEOPLE CONFIRMED

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:12.699
KILLED IN TURKEY.
MORE THAN A THOUSAND ALSO

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:15.602
CONFIRMED KILL IN THE SYRIA AS
WELL, AND YOU'VE GOT THE SEARCH

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:21.007
AND RESCUE OPERATIONS CONTINUING
WITH THOUSANDS OF BUILDINGS

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:24.644
DESTROYED, DAMAGED.
AND MANY, MANY BUILDING JUST

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:27.079
COMPLETELY FLATTENED ACROSS THIS
EARTHQUAKE ZONE.

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:32.952
IT'S A VERY, VERY COMPLEX AND
REALLY CHALLENGING SEARCH AND

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:36.389
RESCUE OPERATION.
THEY'RE FACING MANY CHALLENGES

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:39.058
RIGHTS NOW.
THE AFTERSHOCKS YOU MENTIONED,

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:43.029
MORE THAN 100 AFTERSHOCKS
REPORTED BY TURKISH OFFICIALS,

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:47.967
MAKING IT WERE, VERY DIFFICULT
FOR THE RESCUE CREWS TO RYE AND

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:49.569
PULL PEOPLE FROM UNDER THE
RUBBLE.

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:53.339
IT IS NIGHTTIME RIGHT NOW.
ALSO ANOTHER CHALLENGE.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.175
AND THEN YOU'VE GOT THE WEATHER
CONDITIONS.

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:59.579
THERE'S A SEVERE WINTER STORM
THAT IS IMPACTING THAT PART OF

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:05.585
THE COUNTRY AS WELL AS MANY
PARTS OF TURKEY AS WELL.

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:10.656
ALSO IN SYRIA.
TEMPERATURES DROPPING TO

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:14.427
FREEZING, AND THEN YOU'VE GOT
SNOW, MAKING IT DIFFICULT FOR

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:17.397
THE CREWS TO REACH A LOT OF
THESE AREAS.

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:23.002
AGAIN, WE'RE TALKING ABOUT A
MASSIVE AREA THAT'S IMPACTED AND

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:26.105
THEY ARE TRYING TO REACH AS MANY
AREA AS POSSIBLE.

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:29.108
AND REPORTS OF ROADS BLOCK IN
THE MANY AREAS.

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:31.577
ABSOLUTELY DEVASTATING SITUATION
AS WELL.

00:03:31.577 --> 00:03:37.583
WHEN YOU LOOK AT THE MILLIONS OF
PEOPLE WHO LIVE IN THE

00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:46.492
EARTHQUAKE ZONE BOTH IN SYRIA
AND TURKEY, AUTHORITIES ARE

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:49.662
SCRAMBLING TO SET UP SHELTERS
AND AWAITING THE INTERNATIONAL

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:54.000
RESPONSE FROM COUNTRIES IN
DIFFERENT ORGANIZATIONS,

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:58.938
INCLUDING NATO AND THE EU THAT
WILL BE SUPPORTING TURKEY

00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:08.881
THROUGH THIS DISASTER.
&gt;&gt; SUCH HORRIFIC TO THE BEST OF

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.450
MY KNOWLEDGE -- ESPECIALLY THOSE
IMAGES OF THE CHILDREN THERE,

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.353
JUST HEARTBREAKING.
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:16.255
&gt;&gt;&gt; JOINING ME NOW IS LUCY
JONES.

00:04:16.255 --> 00:04:20.493
SHE'S A SEISMOLOGIST STUDYING
EARTHQUAKES AND THE FOUNDER AND

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:23.162
CHIEF SCIENTIST AT THE DR. LUCY
JONES CENTER.

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:24.330
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR JOINING
US.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:28.701
WE KNOW TURKEY SITS BETWEEN
FAULT LINES AND SMALL TREMORS DO

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:32.772
HAPPEN QUITE OFTEN THERE, BUT
WERE YOU SURPRISED BY THE

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:34.240
MAGNITUDE OF THIS PARTICULAR
EARTHQUAKE?

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.609
&gt;&gt; NO.
WE KNOW THAT EARTHQUAKES OF THIS

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:40.679
SIZE HAVE HAPPENED IN THE PAST
IN TURKEY AND WILL CONTINUE TO,

00:04:40.679 --> 00:04:45.051
BECAUSE WE CAN SEE THE FAULTS
THAT ARE CAPABLE OF IT.

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:52.158
THE MAGNITUDE IS DETERMINED BY
THE FAULT, IN THIS CASE 200

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:55.661
KILOMETERS FOR THE FIRST AND 100
FOR THE SECOND.

00:04:55.661 --> 00:04:59.899
WE NOEVER KNOW WHAT THE TIME WIL
BE, BUT THE FACT IT'S GOING TO

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:02.635
HAPPEN IN SENSE WILL BE A
CERTAINTY.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:04.704
&gt;&gt; AFTERSHOCKS CAN BE JUST AS
DEVASTATING.

00:05:04.704 --> 00:05:09.842
AND KNOWING THE SECOND CAME OUT
AT 7.5, CAN WE EXPECT MORE

00:05:09.842 --> 00:05:12.011
AFTERSHOCKS?
AND WHAT IMPACT DOES THIS HAVE

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:15.681
ON SEARCH AND RESCUE CREWS?
&gt;&gt; RIGHT, SEARCH AND RESCUE

00:05:15.681 --> 00:05:21.254
CREWS REALLY HAVE TO TAKE THIS
EXTRA RISK INTO ACCOUNT.

00:05:21.254 --> 00:05:24.257
WE LIKE TO SAY, WHEN YOU HAVE A
LOT OF EARTHQUAKES YOU TEND TO

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:27.393
HAVE A LOT OFFERS.
WHEN YOU HAVE AN ACTIVE

00:05:27.393 --> 00:05:30.129
AFTERSHOCK SEQUENCE, WHICH IS
WHAT WE'RE SEEING HERE, IT WILL

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:34.934
CONTINUE TO BE MORE ACTIVE.
I'M SURE THEY'RE GOING TO SEE

00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:40.573
MORE MAGNITUDE 6s.
THERE'S A POSSIBILITY FOR A 7.

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:45.378
THE FAULT ON WHICH IT HAPPENED
IS QUITE LONG, AND THERE CAN BE

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:47.046
CONTINUED EARTHQUAKES ON THE
NEXT SECTION OVER.

00:05:47.046 --> 00:05:49.248
THE AFTERSHOCKS ARE DIAGNOSE
OFF.

00:05:49.248 --> 00:05:51.984
THE FIRST DAY WILL HAVE MOST OF
THEM.

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:57.757
THE SECOND DAY WILL HAVE HALF.
THIRD DAY, WILL HAVE A THIRD.

00:05:57.757 --> 00:06:01.360
IT'S A ONE OTHER TIME DECAY.
IT WILL BE GETTING BETTER.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.796
IT WILL HAVE TO BE TAKEN INTO
ACCOUNT IN THE SEARCH AND

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:06.866
RESCUE.
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE SAYING THE AFTERSHOCKS

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:08.167
WILL CONTINUE TO BE FELT.
I KNOW THIS WAS THE WORST

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:13.840
EARTHQUAKE FOR TURKEY IN SOME 80
YEARS, BUT THE COUNTRY HAD

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:18.978
STRICT BUILDING CODES PUT INTO
PLACE SOME DECADES AGO.

00:06:18.978 --> 00:06:30.389
CLEARLY THEY WEREN'T UP TO
STANDARDS.

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:31.858
HOW MUCH OF THE FAULT LIES WITH
THE GOVERNMENT ITSELF IN TERMS

00:06:31.858 --> 00:06:34.594
OF SEISMOLOGISTS GIVING WARNINGS
THIS WAS TO COME, AND CERTAINLY

00:06:34.594 --> 00:06:37.663
MANY OF THESE BUILDS WEREN'T UP
TO STANDARD?

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:41.534
&gt;&gt; DEPENDS ON EXACTLY WHY THE
BUILDINGS CAME DOWN.

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:45.471
BUILDING CODES ARE NOT
RETROACTIVE, SO IF THESE

00:06:45.471 --> 00:06:48.641
BUILDINGS WERE BUILT BEFORE THE
CURRENT CODES COME INTO PLACE,

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:52.478
IT JUST DOESN'T PLAY.
SAME THING IS TRUE EVERYWHERE

00:06:52.478 --> 00:06:55.081
ELSE AS WELL.
WE KNOW WE HAVE BUILDINGS THAT

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:59.385
ARE GOING TO COLLAPSE, BUT THAT
DOESN'T MAKE THEM DISAPPEAR.

00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:02.822
COULD BE IT'S EITHER TOO OLD A
BUILDING, THAT SOMETHING IN THE

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:04.757
MODERN CODE DIDN'T TAKE
SOMETHING INTO ADVANCE.

00:07:04.757 --> 00:07:09.962
THE ENGINEERS ARE GOING TO BE IN
THERE TRYING TO UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:11.297
THERE'S ALSO THE POSSIBILITY
THAT THE DESIGNS WERE NOT

00:07:11.297 --> 00:07:13.866
FOLLOWED OR THE CONSTRUCTION OF
SUB STANDARD, AND THAT'S GOING

00:07:13.866 --> 00:07:18.871
TO REQUIRE AN INVESTIGATION TO
DETERMINE WHY THE BUILDINGS

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:22.074
PERFORMED AS BADLY AS THEY DID.
&gt;&gt; TURKEY'S A LARGE COUNTRYING

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:26.612
BUT LAST YEAR THE URBAN
ENVIRONMENT MINISTER SAID 7

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:28.347
MILLION HOMES WERE AT RISK OF AN
EARTHQUAKE.

00:07:28.347 --> 00:07:31.250
DOES THAT SOUND NORMAL TO YOU?
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:37.557
I MEAN, IT'S A DENSE COUNTRY.
THEY HAVE A LOT OF EARTHQUAKE

00:07:37.557 --> 00:07:39.392
FAULTS.
AND THE BIG ISSUE, IS HOW CLOSE

00:07:39.392 --> 00:07:41.694
ARE YOU TO HOW BIG THE
EARTHQUAKE IS?

00:07:41.694 --> 00:07:46.498
IF YOU'RE 100 MILES AWAY, IT'S
NOT GOING TO BE THAT BAD, BUT IF

00:07:46.498 --> 00:07:49.268
YOU'RE RIGHT ON TOP OF IT, IT
IS.

00:07:49.268 --> 00:07:53.773
LOOKS LIKE 4.5 MILLION PEOPLE
CIRCUMSTANTIAL EVIDENCE SHAKING

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:56.642
STRONG MUST HAVE TO DESTROY AN
OLDER BUILDING, WHICH IS CALLED

00:07:56.642 --> 00:08:00.313
INTENSITY 7.
IT'S NOT MAGNITUDE, BUT AN

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:02.848
INTENSITY SCALE.
4 HADN'T 5 MILLION PEOPLE

00:08:02.848 --> 00:08:04.717
SUBJECTED TO IT JUST IN THE ONE
EARTHQUAKE.

00:08:04.717 --> 00:08:08.788
THAT'S THE SORT OF NUMBER.
IT'S TRUE IN EVERY SEISMIC

00:08:08.788 --> 00:08:12.858
AREA -- WE KNOW THAT OLD
BUILDINGS ARE A PROBLEM, AND IT

00:08:12.858 --> 00:08:15.227
DOESN'T MAKE THEM DISAPPEAR.
&gt;&gt; THIS COMING AS THE WEATHER'S

00:08:15.227 --> 00:08:18.230
IN FREEZING TEMPERATURE THERE
IS, AND AT 4:00 IN THE MORNING,

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:21.734
NOT GIVING FAMILIES MUCH WARNING
TO LEAVE THEIR HOMES FOR SAFETY.

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:23.669
LUCY JONES, THANKS SO MUCH FOR
YOUR TIME.

00:08:23.669 --> 00:08:24.337
WE APPRECIATE IT. 

